sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Knowledge UI
  participant API as Fastify API
  participant JOB as IngestionCoordinator
  participant SRC as SourceResolver
  participant DOC as Parser and Chunker
  participant DB as SQLite and FTS5
  participant EMB as EmbeddingProvider v1

  UI->>API: POST knowledge source
  API->>DB: create source and queued job
  API-->>UI: 202 jobId and eventsUrl
  JOB->>DB: claim job and create indexVersion
  JOB->>SRC: scan source safely
  SRC-->>JOB: files and content hashes
  loop changed documents
    JOB->>DOC: parse and chunk
    DOC-->>JOB: chunks with locators
    JOB->>DB: stage documents chunks and FTS rows
    opt semantic index v1
      JOB->>EMB: embed uncached chunks in batches
      EMB-->>JOB: vectors
      JOB->>DB: stage vector rows
    end
    JOB->>DB: append progress event
  end
  JOB->>DB: atomically publish indexVersion
  DB-->>UI: SSE completed and summary
